              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour, throwing spear, javelins and shield. Army General. Warband. May ride a horse (+11) in which case he becomes Ld8 but is no longer Warband.</characteristic>
